  (text "BellBridge v1.12 - Ritto 7630 TwinBus interface, ESP32-C6-MINI-1"
    (at 30.48 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.6) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ab246caa-3cc3-4f82-aa01-7e2b3c47f134")
  )
  (text "Drawn from the board that hardware/generate.py writes: references, values, footprints, pads and net names match bellbridge.kicad_pcb.\ngenerate.py is the source of truth. Change the board there first, then update this sheet."
    (at 30.48 35.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "08c33007-64b8-41bd-a532-ba21805e2a63")
  )
  (text "USB-C input, ESD protection"
    (at 40.64 63.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "158125bf-fd9c-48a6-a6af-d077c6d95bbb")
  )
  (text "3.3 V supply"
    (at 48.26 134.62 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ef80ad9b-467c-47a6-b874-e470e99693cf")
  )
  (text "ESP32-C6 module, EN reset, strapping pins"
    (at 152.4 63.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "72a8caac-2388-4a01-96bc-0ed80b9fdbed")
  )
  (text "Isolated door output and bell inputs"
    (at 251.46 63.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "32e291f1-dbb5-4902-8692-dddad72b1bab")
  )
  (text "U3 pins 3 and 6 are joined to 4 and 1 inside\nthe package; their pads stay bare on the PCB."
    (at 99.06 106.68 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "189e851d-7bca-4642-8fde-efb3d228b506")
  )
  (text "TP1/TP2: bare pads on the back. Bridge them while\nplugging in USB to start the module in download mode."
    (at 149.86 147.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "42f9d2c4-fe50-43d6-a41c-beff1bf17eb3")
  )
  (text "Unused module pins: no-connect flags here,\nno net on the PCB."
    (at 187.96 157.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "c427b75f-96eb-4fce-b6f5-b194a8e2e526")
  )
  (text "GND_MCU (left) and GND_BUS (right) are galvanically separate:\n1.6 mm copper-free strip on the PCB, LTV-357T rated 3,750 Vrms.\nGPIO19 high: OK1 pulls DOOR to bus ground (street door opens).\nGPIO18 low: 5 V pulse on CHIME (any ring).\nGPIO20 low while FLOOR idles at 5 V; high while the apartment\nbutton pulls FLOOR to ground."
    (at 251.46 193.04 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "0ea77e7d-c3e8-4d3c-b350-0c5da05f4c7f")
  )
  (text "J1 to the Ritto 7630 indoor station:\n1 DOOR  - terminal 5 (door opener)\n2 CHIME - terminal 2 (KLINGEL)\n3 FLOOR - terminal 4 (ETAGE)\n4 GND   - terminal 1 or 6\nNever connect terminal 3 (+24 V)."
    (at 340.36 144.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "ebd2b108-cc45-41ef-81d5-eb4333c16f50")
  )
